sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker (EPP)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant vLLM as vLLM Model Servers
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ Publisher<br/>5557/TCP
    participant Sidecar as PD-Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prefill as Prefill Worker
    participant Decoder as Local Decoder<br/>8200/TCP
    participant Coord as Coordinator<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Render as Rendering Service
    participant IGW as Inference Gateway

    Note over EPP,K8s: Flow 1: EPP Request Routing (ext-proc)
    EPP->>K8s: Watch InferencePool, Pods,<br/>InferenceObjective, InferenceModelRewrite<br/>(ServiceAccount token)
    vLLM->>ZMQ: Publish KV-Events
    ZMQ->>EPP: ZMQ SUB (cache state)
    EPP->>vLLM: Scrape Prometheus metrics<br/>(queue depth, KV-cache util)

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.3
    Envoy->>EPP: ext-proc ProcessingRequest<br/>gRPC/HTTP2 TLS
    Note over EPP: Plugin pipeline:<br/>Filter → Score → Pick endpoint<br/>(KV-cache affinity, queue depth,<br/>priority, flow control)
    EPP-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse<br/>(selected endpoint + headers)
    Envoy->>vLLM: Forward to selected model server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    vLLM-->>Envoy: Inference response (streaming)
    Envoy-->>Client: JSON/SSE response

    Note over Sidecar,Decoder: Flow 2: PD-Sidecar Disaggregated Inference (NIXL v2)
    Envoy->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    Note over Sidecar: Identify disaggregation path<br/>(prefill/decode or encode/prefill/decode)
    Sidecar->>Prefill: Forward prefill request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (configurable TLS)
    Prefill-->>Sidecar: Response with kv_transfer_params<br/>(NIXL agent ID, block hashes)
    Note over Sidecar: Inject KV transfer headers
    Sidecar->>Decoder: Forward decode request<br/>with kv_transfer_params<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8200/TCP
    Note over Decoder: RDMA KV-cache transfer<br/>from prefill worker
    Decoder-->>Sidecar: Streaming response (SSE)
    Sidecar-->>Envoy: Streaming response<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over Coord,IGW: Flow 3: Coordinator Multimodal Pipeline
    Client->>Coord: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP
    Note over Coord: Pipeline Step 1:<br/>Replace media URLs
    Coord->>Coord: Download images from URLs<br/>(SSRF-protected)
    Note over Coord: Pipeline Step 2: Render
    Coord->>Render: Tokenize prompt +<br/>compute placeholders<br/>HTTP
    Render-->>Coord: Tokenized prompt
    Note over Coord: Pipeline Step 3: Encode
    Coord->>IGW: Forward encode request<br/>EPP-Phase: encode header
    IGW-->>Coord: Encode result
    Note over Coord: Pipeline Step 4: Prefill
    Coord->>IGW: Forward prefill request<br/>EPP-Phase: prefill header
    IGW-->>Coord: Prefill result (KV ready)
    Note over Coord: Pipeline Step 5: Decode
    Coord->>IGW: Forward decode request (streaming)<br/>EPP-Phase: decode header
    IGW-->>Coord: Streaming tokens
    Coord-->>Client: Streaming response (SSE)
